 "recommendation": {
  "finding": "The notice is genuine in form: Li Wei, the Sales Manager on file for Shenzhen Yunzhan, says a fire at its Bao'an Plant 2 stops delivery for now. It covers ten open lines on four POs for five motors, and the supplier says partial recovery will take 6 to 8 weeks, with revised dates promised by 10 October. Four lines were already past their promised dates on 25 September. Dana Reyes should lead the reply, with Sofia Marino copied. She should ask for line-by-line revised dates and allocation, and read the supplier's claim under clause 14 of the 2023 Supply Agreement against the contract rather than accept it. Do not act on the separate payment-change email from a look-alike domain; it is blocked. Verify any payment change by phone with the contact on file. There is no rename, so I have proposed no supplier link and staged no draft.",
